   "install": {
    "title": "Getting started",
    "html": "<p>Visit the official Airflow website documentation (latest <strong>stable</strong> release) for help with\n<a href=\"https://airflow.apache.org/docs/apache-airflow/stable/installation/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">installing Airflow</a>,\n<a href=\"https://airflow.apache.org/docs/apache-airflow/stable/start.html\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">getting started</a>, or walking\nthrough a more complete <a href=\"https://airflow.apache.org/docs/apache-airflow/stable/tutorial/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tutorial</a>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Note: If you're looking for documentation for the main branch (latest development branch): you can find it on <a href=\"https://s.apache.org/airflow-docs/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">s.apache.org/airflow-docs</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>For more information on Airflow Improvement Proposals (AIPs), visit\nthe <a href=\"https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/AIRFLOW/Airflow+Improvement+Proposals\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Airflow Wiki</a>.</p>\n<p>Documentation for dependent projects like provider distributions, Docker image, Helm Chart, you'll find it in <a href=\"https://airflow.apache.org/docs/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">the documentation index</a>.</p>",
